---
import En from '../../../layouts/En.astro';
import tours from '../../../data/en/tour-prices.json';
import rental from '../../../data/en/rental-prices.json';
---
<En
  title="Tour and Rental Prices | Diving Shop ABARO"
  description="Day-tour prices for Izu Peninsula dive sites and rental equipment rates at ABARO, Shizuoka. All-inclusive fees covering guiding, tanks, facilities, insurance and lunch."
  heading="Prices"
  jaPath="/one-day-tour-日帰りツアー料金/"
  sub="Tours &amp; rental"
>
  <h2>Day tours</h2>
  <p>
    Prices include guiding, facility fees, tanks, weights, insurance, lunch and
    transport from the shop. Certified divers of Master Scuba Diver rating and above
    receive the discounts shown in the last two columns.
  </p>
  <div class="en-table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Dive site</th><th>Style</th><th>Price (OW–Rescue)</th><th>MSD</th><th>DM and above</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {tours.map((t) => (
          <tr>
            <td>{t.point}</td>
            <td>{t.style}</td>
            <td class="num">{t.price}</td>
            <td class="num">{t.msd || '—'}</td>
            <td class="num">{t.dm || '—'}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p class="en-note">
    All prices include tax. Overnight and overseas trips are priced separately — ask us.
  </p>

  <h2>Rental equipment</h2>
  <p>Rental gear is for ABARO tours only.</p>
  <div class="en-table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Item</th><th>Per day</th><th>Annual pass</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {rental.map((r) => (
          <tr>
            <td>{r.item}</td>
            <td class="num">{r.day}</td>
            <td class="num">{r.year}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p class="en-note">
    Sizes and stock are limited, so we cannot always supply the exact type you want.
    Lost or damaged equipment is charged to the renter. Everyone on an ABARO tour
    wears a dive computer on every dive.
  </p>
</En>
